<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <title>Antarctica checkout · bitcoin++</title>
  {{ block "header" . }}{{ end }}
  {{ template "admin_favicon" "" }}
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/static/css/antarctica-admin.css?v=20261024">
</head>
<body class="expedition-admin">
  <main class="expedition-admin__shell">
    <a class="expedition-admin__back" href="/admin">← Global administration</a>
    <header class="expedition-admin__hero">
      <div><p class="expedition-admin__eyebrow">Cold Storage Edition · January 24–February 5, 2028</p><h1>Antarctica checkout</h1><p>Manage reservations, booking terms and launch readiness.</p></div>
      <a class="ea-button ea-button--secondary" href="/antarctica">View expedition ↗</a>
    </header>
    {{ if .Flash }}<div class="ea-notice" role="status">{{ .Flash }}</div>{{ end }}

    <div class="expedition-admin__overview">
      <section class="ea-card" aria-labelledby="reservations-title">
        <div class="ea-card__heading"><h2 id="reservations-title">Reservations</h2><span class="ea-status {{ if .Enabled }}ea-status--open{{ end }}">{{ if .Enabled }}Open{{ else }}Paused{{ end }}</span></div>
        <p>Control new purchases. Existing bookings and installment payments remain available when checkout is paused.</p><p class="ea-help">Passage uses the standard conference-ticket tax classification. No sales tax is added; merchandise is separate.</p>
        {{ if .Blockers }}
        <div class="ea-readiness" role="status"><h3>Needed before opening</h3><p>Resolve these items, then check again using the button below.</p><ul>{{ range .Blockers }}<li>{{ . }}</li>{{ end }}</ul></div>
        {{ else }}
        <div class="ea-readiness ea-readiness--ready"><h3>Ready to open checkout</h3><p>Complete a real payment and check the confirmation email before announcing the launch.</p></div>
        {{ end }}
        <form method="post" class="ea-actions"><input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="{{ .CSRF }}"><span class="ea-help">The expedition remains unlisted on the main site.</span><button class="ea-button" name="action" value="{{ if .Enabled }}pause{{ else }}open{{ end }}">{{ if .Enabled }}Pause Antarctica checkout{{ else }}Open Antarctica checkout{{ end }}</button></form>
      </section>

      <section class="ea-card" aria-labelledby="inventory-title">
        <div class="ea-card__heading"><h2 id="inventory-title">Inventory setup</h2></div>
        <p>Initialize missing berth categories using the approved allocation.</p>
        <dl class="ea-inventory"><div><dt>Twin berths</dt><dd>18</dd></div><div><dt>Triple berths</dt><dd>3</dd></div><div><dt>Quad berths</dt><dd>4</dd></div></dl>
        <p class="ea-help">These are setup defaults, not remaining availability. Existing settings, staff reserves and bookings are preserved.</p>
        <details class="ea-details"><summary>Sales window &amp; unpaid holds</summary><div><p>New booking windows end January 1, 2027 at 00:00 UTC, when the first scheduled installment falls due. Unpaid checkout holds last one hour.</p></div></details>
        <form method="post" class="ea-actions"><input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="{{ .CSRF }}"><button class="ea-button ea-button--secondary" name="action" value="inventory">Initialize missing inventory</button></form>
      </section>
    </div>

    <section class="ea-card ea-policy" aria-labelledby="policy-title">
      <div class="ea-card__heading"><h2 id="policy-title">Booking policy</h2><a href="/expeditions/antarctica/terms" target="_blank" rel="noopener">View public terms ↗</a></div>
      {{ with .Current }}<div class="ea-policy-current"><span class="ea-status ea-status--open">Published</span><div><strong>{{ .Version }}</strong><p>Effective {{ .EffectiveAt.UTC.Format "January 2, 2006 · 15:04 MST" }}</p></div></div>{{ else }}<p>No policy has been published. Review the prepared terms and privacy information below, then publish them for new bookings.</p>{{ end }}
      <form method="post" class="ea-policy-form">
        <input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="{{ .CSRF }}"><input type="hidden" name="action" value="publish">
        <div class="ea-form-grid">
          <div class="ea-field"><label for="policy-version">New policy version</label><input id="policy-version" name="version" value="{{ .Version }}" maxlength="200" required><p class="ea-help">Use a new version whenever the text changes.</p></div>
          <div class="ea-field"><label for="policy-effective">Effective date · UTC</label><input id="policy-effective" name="effective" value="{{ .Effective }}" required aria-describedby="effective-help"><p class="ea-help" id="effective-help">ISO format, for example 2026-10-24T12:00:00Z. Must not be in the future.</p></div>
        </div>
        <details class="ea-editor" open><summary>Booking terms <span>Review &amp; edit</span></summary><div class="ea-field"><label class="ea-sr-only" for="policy-terms">Booking terms</label><textarea id="policy-terms" name="terms" rows="16" required maxlength="262144">{{ .Terms }}</textarea></div></details>
        <details class="ea-editor"><summary>Privacy policy <span>Review &amp; edit</span></summary><div class="ea-field"><label class="ea-sr-only" for="policy-privacy">Privacy policy</label><textarea id="policy-privacy" name="privacy" rows="14" required maxlength="262144">{{ .Privacy }}</textarea></div></details>
        <div class="ea-publish">
          <label class="ea-review"><input type="checkbox" name="reviewed" value="yes" required><span>I have reviewed these terms and privacy information and approve them for new bookings, including reminders and abandonment after 30 days overdue in America/Chicago time.</span></label>
          <div class="ea-actions"><p class="ea-help">Publishing saves this exact text and version. Existing purchasers keep the policy they accepted.</p><button class="ea-button" type="submit">Publish booking policy</button></div>
        </div>
      </form>
    </section>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
